---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: project.run(args)
---
Show or change settings. Without arguments all settings are listed; with a key the value is shown; with a key and a value it is changed; --unset restores the default.

Usage: claudegrep config [OPTIONS] [KEY] [VALUE]

Arguments:
  [KEY]
          Setting to show or change

  [VALUE]
          New value

Options:
      --unset
          Reset the setting to its default

      --all
          Use every project's sessions, not only those of the current directory

      --since <WHEN>
          Only sessions active since WHEN: a date (2026-10-14) or an age (30m, 6h, 2d, 1w, 3mo)

      --until <WHEN>
          Only sessions active until WHEN: a date (whole day included) or an age

      --db <FILE>
          Database with the index, the transcript archive and the settings
          
          [env: CLAUDEGREP_DB=[ROOT]/db.sqlite]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
